{"parse": {"title": "8TH-02", "pageid": 69775, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/8TH-01\" title=\"8TH-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">8TH-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/8TH-03\" title=\"8TH-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">8TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.A1.86.E4.B8.AD.E6.97.A7.E5.BD.B1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"框中旧影\">框中旧影</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 框中旧影</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A New Photo of an Old Friend</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>雨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>水<span class=\"color-value\"></span>堆<span class=\"color-value\"></span>积<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>倒<span class=\"color-value\"></span>影<span class=\"color-value\"></span>中<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>她<span class=\"color-value\"></span>看<span class=\"color-value\"></span>见<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>熟<span class=\"color-value\"></span>悉<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>故<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10802</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_zhinuojidi\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_zhinuojidi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>柱廊阴影下，少女咬着冷饮吸管，无所事事地晃腿踢打空气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>庭院荒芜，石缝之间的杂草顽强生长着，骄傲地对抗着圣保罗的烈日。<br />甲虫从一处草丛爬向另一处草丛，而这一切都被少女看在眼里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-517910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-517910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-517910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>一个人待这儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女士沿着破落的大理石柱慢慢走来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>凉荫下的少女抬手遮住刺眼的阳光，看向来客——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>嗯？姐姐！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>和她在同一位“父亲”身边长大的莫莉德尔姐姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她扔掉饮料，像只摇着尾巴的小狼犬，藏不住笑脸，跑向姐姐。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_at_yongbao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_at_yongbao\"><img alt=\"2_2_at_yongbao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_2_at_yongbao.png/600px-Cg-2_2_at_yongbao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_2_at_yongbao.png/900px-Cg-2_2_at_yongbao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_2_at_yongbao.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_at_yongbao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>噢——慢点，慢点，扑上来这一下……真有劲儿，哈哈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>副官女士摸着妹妹的脑袋，将她搂紧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>你长高了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>那你肯定长胖了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“礼尚往来”，她也伸手探进姐姐衣服里，摸到对方柔软的肚腩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>洛佩拉——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>会痒的，别闹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个小小的恶作剧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>这次过来待多久？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>不多久，很快，很快就要走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>父亲对圣保罗的事情很生气，向总部要求临时调来这儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>作为老将军最信任的副官和孩子，她随老将军一同来到圣保罗的基地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>等下一任长官过来，或许到时候你可以跟我们一起走……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>副官女士有些迟疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只有伊戈尔将军能决定所有人的去留——无论她，还是洛佩拉，抑或是其他任何人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>是吗？喔……我其实还挺喜欢这边，荣军院的老头儿和老奶奶都是些有意思的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>很高兴看到你有新朋友，老人的智慧向来值得尊重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>哎呀……你说教的样子跟老爹越来越像了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>他人呢？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_zhinuojidi\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_zhinuojidi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她左右张望，而老将军显然不在附近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>父亲和基金会的司辰去办公室谈话了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>喔～所以你是偷偷溜出来的喽？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>偷偷溜出来找我对不对！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>不，我是想来……锄草，基地里荒了很多地方，到处都得打扫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>锄草。一个荒唐的理由，走过一个又一个庭院，绕过一片片荒地，就为了寻找一株活蹦乱跳的“杂草”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>撒谎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>姐姐你耳根红了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是她的顽疾，是她的羞赧和她的诚实，正如嘴会说谎，但梦永远诚实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-302901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>好了，一起去会客室吧，基金会来的客人还在等我，可不能让父亲知道我们偷偷跑出来了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>哇我跟你讲，我们突袭上校庄园的时候，还抓回一个很难搞的俘虏……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>圣保罗城里还有一艘装在瓶子里的小船……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>草丛间，彩羽毛的蜂鸟望着有说有笑远去的两人背影，又转而看向基地南边的棕色高塔……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_huikeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_huikeshi\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_huikeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-2_2_bg_huikeshi.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_huikeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-2_2_bg_huikeshi.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_huikeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-2_2_bg_huikeshi.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_huikeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>屋内简单、硬朗、整洁，满是军队做派。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苏芙比和她的飞行员伙伴无所事事地打量着这间会客室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>退伍军人们的合照按照年份排布，光荣地悬挂在墙上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>嗯……1968年，一座古老的城市。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵们看上去表情阴沉，不愿面对镜头，那是一场没有鲜花与荣誉的胜利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>这个地方叫做……伊兹、密尔。嗯……伊兹密尔是什么地方？会有阿邦·阿库吗？我还从来没有去过这里呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>枣椰树下，结队的士兵远眺向古老而富庶的地中海海岸，留下了一张宝贵的影像。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>1986年，里约热内卢……唔……里约热……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>——咦，等、等等？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>里约热内卢。海岸边，她隐约看到了一张熟悉得不能再熟悉的脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>卡森先生为什么会在那儿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她接连蹦起，试图取下那副沉重的木相框。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一张熟悉的脸出现在相片上，但那位先生早已消失在了1929年的“暴雨”中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>怎么，连这儿你都有熟人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>飞行员为矮个子的伙伴取下相框。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-300912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-300912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-300912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>天哪！卡森先生！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她绝不会认错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尽管改换发色，蓬发让他看起来比从前热情不少，但硬朗的五官与她记忆中老人的浮影重合，渐渐合为一人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300916.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-300916.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300916.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300916.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-300916.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300916.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-300916.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300916.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>可是“暴雨”不是把他……我亲眼看到卡森先生……消失……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-300411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-300411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-300411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>“暴雨”？你在说什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苏芙比连连摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300919.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-300919.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300919.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300919.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-300919.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300919.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-300919.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300919.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>——不对不对，他和卡森先生就是同一个人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/HeadIconSmall-300911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/HeadIconSmall-300911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/HeadIconSmall-300911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>世界上没有长得这么像的人，所以如果一个人长得跟另一个人一样……嗯，那他们……他们肯定就是同一个人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-300912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-300912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-300912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>你看，这个鼻子……这个眼睛……嗯，虽然他没有戴眼镜，但是这条皱纹很明显……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她自言自语，甚至有点儿语无伦次。相框中的老人令她感到不可思议——无论是那张与卡森先生几乎完全一致的长相，还是热烈张扬的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>严肃的老管家绝不会露出这样的笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300919.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-300919.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300919.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300919.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-300919.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300919.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-300919.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300919.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>不行，我、我必须贴近瞧瞧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300921.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-300921.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300921.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300921.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-300921.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300921.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-300921.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300921.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>啊，也许是我弄错了？但为什么会有长得一模一样的两个人呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一千零一个问号在小淑女的脑子里像魔药试管中的泡泡一样咕噜咕噜冒出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她瞪大眼睛，举起相框，近得连鼻子都贴上了堆满灰尘的相框玻璃——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300916.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-300916.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300916.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300916.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-300916.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300916.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-300916.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300916.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>难道……卡森管家他、他……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她被灰尘呛了个喷嚏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/HeadIconSmall-300911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/HeadIconSmall-300911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/HeadIconSmall-300911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>阿、阿嚏……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老将军走进了会客室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>莫莉德尔呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他环视房间各处，但这儿没有一位叫做“莫莉德尔”的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>将军，司辰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>飞行员看到将军到来，立刻挺直身躯，行礼致敬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>维尔汀！快来看看！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苏芙比握着一个相框，激动地挥手——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>卡森先生……他好像、好像还活着——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>嗯？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他还活着？！从众人眼前消失，被1929年的“暴雨”回溯的卡森先生，竟然还活着？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>苏芙比在退伍老兵们的合照里看到了她的家人。维尔汀，你也认识这位卡森先生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>你看这里——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他曾消失在1929年的雨幕中，如同一位从舞台上被抹去的演员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>他长得……确实和卡森管家非常相似，如果我没有记错的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可现在却出现在另一张照片上……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老将军走过来，看着苏芙比手中的旧照片，看向她手指指向的老人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>有很多了不起的战士永远留在了亚马孙河的急流里，但也有更多的侥幸得生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>他就是其中一位勇敢的幸运儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>不过，我不太明白你们聊的话题。你们以前曾经见过这位士兵？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们有一位朋友被1929年的“暴雨”回溯，他和这位先生很像。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>事实上，将军，他们……几乎长得一模一样。这简直不可思议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>虽然换了衣服……虽然……但他肯定就是卡森先生！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这位老先生让她想念起了自己的老管家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>那这真是件有意思的事情，嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这位老先生，他现在还在世吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>如果他活着，现在也该在圣保罗的荣军院。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>圣保罗，荣军院。<br />像河流交汇的小岛，秘密和答案都聚在那儿的沙滩上，等着水鸟叼走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>大～家好～！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-517911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-517911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-517911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>抱歉让各位久等……了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>行刑场上的少女和另一位女士来到会客厅，却迎面遇上老将军冷铁一样的脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>将、将军……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "8TH-02"}}